Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(非洲)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备起飞！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Wind her up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么蒙特卡洛，要么九泉之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Monte Carlo or bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 起落架  - 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Struts.  - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 机翼  - 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flaps.  - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 钻石和黄金  - 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diamonds and gold.  - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们几周后在赌城玩够了就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be back from our gambling spree  in a couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见  - 或者金子用完的时候我们再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye!  - Or whenever the gold runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见啦  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buh-bye!  - Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一路走好，等着你们回来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! We'll be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑，我们才不会回来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding!  We're never coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么，你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时空加速启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate warp drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是说再也不会回来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they just say  they were never coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了，你在这儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, goody, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要尝尝这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just chew on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你开玩笑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我几年前尾巴就没感觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost all feeling  in this thing years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼？你怎么长成那样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melman? Why do you look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁家孩子在说话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格洛丽亚？你们怎么看起来都这么…老？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloria? Why are you guys so... elderly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近一次照镜子是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, when was the last time  you looked in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒！醒醒！亚力…亚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up! Wake up, Ally-Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 醒醒！  - 马蒂！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake up!  - Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂，太吓人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, it was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又做那个噩梦了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That same nightmare again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被困在非洲这边了，  都年纪大了，脸上还长满皱纹…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were stuck here in Africa,  and we were all super-old and wrinkly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，我也老了，  但是你们看上去都糟透了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I aged well,  but the rest of you looked terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放松，亚力克斯，  我们为你准备了一个惊喜！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, Alex.  'Cause I got a surprise for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是企鹅们回来了吗？  他们准备把我们带回家吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it the penguins?  Have they come to take us home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是，是第二好的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. But it's the next best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是无聊的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another day bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了，小心，小心草皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it. Watch yourself. Small divots!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，有点陡，爬上小上坡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, little incline there.  Back up this hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有根低悬的树枝，就在悬崖边，看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A low-hanging branch,  then just over this bluff and voil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐，老兄！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇！纽约城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格洛丽亚，你是自由女神！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloria! You're the Statue of Liberty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快，给个大拥抱吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me your huddled masses, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼，你是布鲁克林大桥！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Melman,  you're the Brooklyn Bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实，我是三区大桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I'm the Triboro Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是你们做的嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! You guys made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，凭记忆做的，  凭着对纽约冲动而迷恋的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. From memory!  From crazy, obsessive memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第五大道…还不堵车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Fifth Avenue... with no traffic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时代广场，摩登时尚却毫无个性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Times Square, with its  modern-day corporate lack of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一条街上有9家杜恩里德药店！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine Duane Reades on the same street!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有动物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个迷你版的我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! There's a little me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有迷你版的所有人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And little all of us-es!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯！亚力克斯！亚力克斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们，你们让我悲喜交加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys.  You've both made and ruined my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,许个愿吧，亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a wish, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的美梦成真了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wish has come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的胃在叫！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My tummy is speaking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢，真恶心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是你，我不会吃那块蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't eat that side of the cake  if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯，你许了什么愿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, what was your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我们都能回家  不要误解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wished we could go home.  I mean, don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱这个礼物，但它不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this.  But it's not the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它是泥塑的模型，亚力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because it's a mud model, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真的纽约，这点很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not actually New York.  I hope that was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指望企鹅回来带走我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are relying on the penguins  to come back for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是…我们应该直接去蒙特卡洛找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... we should just go to Monte Carlo  and get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一个狮子，一个斑马，  一个长颈鹿，一个河马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do a lion, a zebra,  a giraffe and a hippo walk
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能进蒙特卡洛的赌场？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a casino in Monte Carlo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道，问牧师吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Ask the rabbi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是认真的  - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, I'm serious.  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到！  我们什么都做得到！团结就是力量！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do it!  We can do anything! It's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,团结就是力量！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样，我们都快环游过世界了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.  We've gone halfway around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相比之下，蒙特卡洛真是近在咫尺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compared with that, Monte Carlo's  just a hop, skip and a swim away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为了回家！  - 为了回家！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Home!  - Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为了回家  - 为了汉堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Home.  - Cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎么着，企鹅们见到我们肯定会很开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what, bet those penguins  will be glad to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，他们肯定无聊死了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're probably  bored out of their minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我玩枕头大战，你们都太娘们儿啦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pillow fight  like a bunch of little girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠，这些枕头都是用小鸟羽毛做的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chimichanga! These pillows  are filled with baby birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《马达加斯加3：欧洲通缉犯》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(蒙特卡洛港口)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里，赌场！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. The casino!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说，太好了  我们能在这里找到企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "Perfect.  That's where we'll find the penguins."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅们天生不会低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Penguin Extraction  does not include levity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让自己引起注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't draw attention to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是隐身的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're invisible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讲话很轻很轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking really, really quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家快来一起跳！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody dance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶！耶！耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家快来一起跳！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody dance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.89,0:06:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一步，闯进赌场，逮住企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Phase One: We break  into the casino, grab the penguins,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们用猴子驱动的超级飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get them  to take us back to New York
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我们回纽约！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the Monkey-Powered Super Plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二步，我们严厉谴责，  企鹅在非洲抛弃我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase Two: We chew out the penguins  for abandoning us in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三步，我们跟企鹅道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase Three:  We apologize to the penguins
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说对他们谴责太过严厉，  但是要点到为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for overly harsh chewing outing,  but we've gotten our point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第四步，回到纽约城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase Four: Back to New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太好了！  - 这计划我喜欢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes!  - I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了，我们沿着这些通风管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we take  these ventilation ducts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爬进赌场的通风管，找到企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the crawlspace above the casino  where we find the penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是，每个人该对应哪个管道呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to figure out  which duct each of us should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 贝斯低音回响 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Pause back with the bass ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即兴表演上场  抓住美好时光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ The jam is live in effect and I don't waste time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 麦克风在手  演绎淋漓酣畅 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ On the mic with a dope rhyme ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 跟着节奏跳吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Jump to the rhythm ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 跳吧  跟着节奏跳吧  跳吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Jump, jump to the rhythm, jump... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨，亲爱的  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, honey.  - OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好，我来抓着你  我来抓着你，亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, OK. I got you. I got you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会让动物踏上赌场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, they're not gonna let  animals on to the casino floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅一定是做了伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so expect some kind of disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看！那个很丑的女人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that!  That is one ugly, mug-ugly lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丑到人神共愤啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is roach-killing ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是女人，是凡尔赛之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a lady.  That's the King of Versailles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是凡尔赛之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's not the King of Versailles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是猩猩，猩猩就像是烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the chimps.  And the chimps are like smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里有烟，哪里就有火  这里的火，就是企鹅！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where there's smoke, there's fire.  And by fire, I mean the penguins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凡尔赛之王又赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King of Versailles wins again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我的没错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we let it ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要重拾嬉皮士那一套，荣归纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll pick up the hippies  and fly back to New York in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能买一架空客A380吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we buy an Airbus A-380?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买架纯金的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solid gold, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官！纯金的飞机是飞不起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir! A solid gold plane  wouldn't be able to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科瓦斯基，我们是有钱人！  有钱人才不受物理学的限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowalski, we'll be rich!  The rules of physics don't apply to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的，2分17秒后狐猴将切断电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. In exactly two minutes and 17  seconds, the lemurs will cut the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:08:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在？  - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在行了么？  - 再等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在呢？  - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吊下去，抓住企鹅，  你把我拉上来，我们就撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drop down, grab the penguins.  You crank me up, and we are out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我吊下去！我来抓企鹅！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me drop down!  I'll grab the penguins!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有手指，马蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have fingers, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在，切断  - 不，等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now? Do it?  - No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是领导者想的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are things a leader  has to think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你来当领导者？为什么不是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should you be the leader?  Why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我掌握着计划！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm the phase tracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凡尔赛之王现在还在玩呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king is letting it ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我怎么就不知道？  - 你是计划的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did I get phased out?  - You're part of a phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划不是纸上谈兵的，你要去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A phase isn't something you own,  it's something you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁选你当大计划领导的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who voted you  Grand Phase Master anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我，我自己，因为我就是领导者！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me! I voted me!  'Cause I'm the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 黑色！  - 没错，宝贝！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Black!  - That's it, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在可以了吧？  - 不行！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now?  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凡尔赛之王全胜！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The King of Versailles wins it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许我应该来管  - 梅尔曼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I should be in charge.  - Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是现在！  - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now!  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们不能都成为领导者？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we all be leaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了！我来领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! I'm gonna lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,近来如何，小猫咪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's new, pussycat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦！哇哦！哇哦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂，我们这是第几步了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what phase are we at?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三步，道歉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase Three: Apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对，老兄，我们实在抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Oh, man, we are so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系，我们滚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apology accepted. Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂，我们跳过了第二步！  我们都没有谴责他们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! We skipped Phase Two!  We didn't chew them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不关我的事，我听领导的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me.  I'm just following the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在  - 我现在忙着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now!  - I'm a bit busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快把开关拉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just pull the switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼，灯怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck is going on  with the lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 俺告诉你俺想要啥  俺真的想要啥 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo, tell me what you want.  What you really, really want ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 俺告诉你俺想要啥  俺真的想要啥 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'll tell you what I want.  What I really, really want... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在磨蹭什么？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动一级戒备！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate lockdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把动物管制中心的杜波依队长找来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get me Captain Dubois  from Animal Control!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斑马？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A zebra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,河马？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hippo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.49,0:11:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长颈鹿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A giraffe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有狮子？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我七岁的时候，掐死了我第一个鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was seven,  I strangled my first parrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,溺死第一条金鱼，打死第一条蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}flushed my first goldfish,  punched my first snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我终于迎来了一个崭新的时刻，  我的一生都在为这一刻准备着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I have finally reached the moment  I have been preparing for my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我职业的巅峰：\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pinnacle of my career:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捕猎百兽之王！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To hunt the king of the beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是吧  - 紧闭了，是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no.  - Lockdown, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，各位，往后站，  放着我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everybody, stand back.  I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错，第一印象的机会只有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you only get one chance  at a first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 刚刚怎么了？  - 我们在哪儿，这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What just happened?  - Where are we? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们叫它，  豪华突袭游乐车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call it  the Luxury Assault Recreational Vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这引擎真爽！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car goes vroom-vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step on it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(动物控制中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杜波依队长，见到你太好了，  你绝对想不到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Dubois, I am so happy  to see you! You will not believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚回去，白痴！  你那破古龙水盖住动物体香了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back, you fool! Your cheap cologne  is obscuring the animal musk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脸好痛！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的小动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor, poor animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不该离开森林的，现在你们是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should never have left the forest.  Now you deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科瓦斯基，放信号，让猩猩们开超级飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowalski, signal the chimps to meet us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到老地方来接我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the rendezvous point  with the Super Plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国宾大酒店，前进！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hotel Ambassador. Let's move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧？长颈鹿在12点方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voil? Giraffe at twelve o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们，我们被盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we've got a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗仔队！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paparazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,油门踩到底，二等兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pedal to the metal, Private.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禁止拍照哦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take any photos, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.61,0:13:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要…拍…照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take... any... photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要再拍了！  - 军医！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No more pictures!  - Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 预计抵达时间？  - 2分37秒，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ETA to rendezvous point?  - Two minutes, 37 seconds, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备开战！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man your battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！没人握方向盘！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wait! Nobody's at the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去！司机空缺！没有司机！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back there! Negative on the driver!  There's no driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！无人驾驶！  不要！会出车祸的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Nobody's driving!  Oh, no! We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要光坐那儿，绣花枕头，  抓住方向盘！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't just sit there, fancy pants.  Grab the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑？  我才不开车，我是纽约人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding?  I don't drive. I'm a New Yorker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挪开，狮子妹妹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move over, Miss Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛？斑马才不能开车！  只有企鹅和人会开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Zebras can't drive!  Only penguins and people can drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些按钮是用来干嘛的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do all these buttons do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好，条纹哥！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice one, Stripes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疯女人靠近了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy woman gaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧米茄3号滑动障碍会搞定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Omega-3 slick will take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二等兵，出手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Private, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还不错嘛！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科瓦斯基，人肉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowalski, intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.79,0:15:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官，问题很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. We have a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香塔尔·杜波依队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Chantal Dubois.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩纳哥动物控制中心，  完美记录持有者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monaco Animal Control.  Perfect case record.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开错路了，马蒂！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going the wrong way, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快叫我马蒂奥·安德烈蒂  <i>注：马里奥·安德烈蒂，著名赛车手</i>\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just call me Marty-o Andretti.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是，你是傻逼奥·安德烈蒂！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You're Sucky-o Andretti!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要指手画脚了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop backseat driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在帮你，快把方向盘给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm passenger-seat driving.  Give me the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才不是方向盘，是我的命根子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a wheel, it's my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的蹄子不是用来抓方向盘的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hoofs aren't meant to be  on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在想开车，来不及了！  - 别看着我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Too late for you to drive!  - Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吵架的时候别看我！看路！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me when we argue!  Look at the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静冷静！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be cool, be cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，长官，有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Officer. Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马力要再大点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮到科瓦斯基的核反应堆上场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to fire up  Kowalski's nucular reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是核反应堆？  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a nuclear reactor?  - Nucular.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在车顶上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但长官，还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir, it's not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制棒还要校准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The control rods  will have to be calibrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更别说缺少铀238了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't even ask me  about the Uranium-238 blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂，我们甩掉她了！  你现在可以慢下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Marty, we lost her!  Maybe you can slow down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢不下来！没有刹车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't! There's no brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有刹车？  这是要军法从事的啊，新兵蛋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No brakes?  Way to commit, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跳车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快快快，现在就跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go! Move! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都去哪儿呀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where's everybody going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在飞！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在飞耶！我是第一个能飞的猴子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flying!  I'm the first flying monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有办法离开这儿了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our ticket out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家快上猴梯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody!  On the monkey chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香蕉弹上膛！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy banana gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住这些小家伙，把它们扔上去！  快跑，快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the little guys! Toss them up!  Let's go! Go, go, go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快！快！赶紧跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster! Faster! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快上了，梅尔曼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的脖子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐回去！发双倍香蕉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your backs into it!  Double banana overtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S形飞行！S形飞行！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serpentine! Serpentine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这女人真的开始吓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this lady's  really starting to freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定她，莫特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fix it, Mort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯，小心点！她是疯女人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, be careful! She's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就你知道么，马蒂？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think, Marty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定！回家！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right! Home free, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能呼吸了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜，杜波依！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au revoir, Dubois!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算你狠，狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well played, lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好戏才刚刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 纽约，纽约，了不起的城市 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ New York, New York  It's a heck of a town ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- ∮ 布朗克斯在上 ∮  - ∮ 但炮台公园在下 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-  ∮ The Bronx is up ∮  - ∮ But the Battery's down ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 纽约，纽约 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ New York, New York ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:19:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科瓦斯基，汇报状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kowalski, status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息是，这首歌快结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the good news is  this song is almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了，坏消息呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's music to my ears.  And the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,齿轮传动装置严重损毁，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gear assembly is  badly damaged, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是时间问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a matter of time before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不能正常着陆一次么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we ever  just make a normal landing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼，坚持住好么？  我会把你弄下来的，亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Melman. OK?  I'll get you down, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿？  要找到朱利安国王，朱利安国王！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?  Must find King Julien. King Julien!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 天越来越热 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ It's getting hot in here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 不如脱掉你的皮 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ So take off all your fur ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我越来越热 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I am getting so hot ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我想脱掉我的皮 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I want to take my fur off ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大，飞机状况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skipper, what about the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猩猩们会连夜修理的，  不分昼夜，舍身忘己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chimps will work through the night.  No breaks, no safety restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你们去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回来！我们签了合同的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here! We have a contract!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过，  恐怕法国的劳动法稍许宽松那么一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Well, I'm afraid labor laws  are slightly more lenient in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一年只要工作两个礼拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, they only have to work  two weeks a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，总有人有白求恩的职业操守吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, someone else  has the Canadian work ethic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们企鹅，还是可以修好的是吗？是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you penguins,  you can still fix it, right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊是啊，你们是一只无敌小分队啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. You're  a little crackerjack, can-do team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们希望我说实话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to give it to you straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好！好！不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以稍微婉转一点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bend it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这架飞机彻底不行了，  坏了，报废了，完结了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the plane's totaled.  Kaput, blammo, busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也飞不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never to fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样？我们再也回不了家了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it? That's it then,  we're never gonna get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！我们一定得回家！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! We've got to get home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以修好！我们能修好！  来吧！伙计们！我们能修好它！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can fix it! We'll fix it!  Yeah, guys, come on, we'll fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.17,0:21:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先把外面的弄好，然后修里面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just start from the outside pieces,  and you work your way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像这样！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, yeah, perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.67,0:21:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀，不要光站着看！  马蒂，把那边那玩意儿拖过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Don't just stand there, guys.  Marty! Drag that thingy over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要把这坨接在一块儿，  然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll just attach it  to this dealy-bob over here. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.35,0:21:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都回不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're never going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是警车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the fuzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办？  我们躲得了一时躲不了一世啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?  We can't hide forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们还不能藏起来！这又不是非洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we can't just blend!  You know this ain't Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想有没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me one conceivable way  that extra-large animals like us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们这种大型动物穿越欧洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are gonna be able  to move through Europe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不引起注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without attracting unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(马戏团  萨拉戈萨)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.76,0:22:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们哪儿冒出来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你，让我们避一避风头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, you got to hide us.  Just until the heat dies down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外来人员不让进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolut no outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把眼泪鼻涕擦擦干净，滚吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So wipe that Smirnoff your face  and Popov!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙吧，我们都是猫科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. You gotta do  one cat a solid. Cat to cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿，帮个忙嘛，求您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do a solid here, buddy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！这列火车只载马戏团动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyet! This train is  for circus animals only.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.31,0:22:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去他们好像遇上麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sound like they be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺，我们不引狮入室，  我不信任狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano, we do not invite trouble  into our circus. I don't trust lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,油头粉面的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hair too big and glossy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.65,0:22:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利，别这么小气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on, Vitaly, you're being mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是公狮，  是母狮…还带着一窝崽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He not lion.  He lioness... with a beehive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太尴尬了，我们都听见他们说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awkward.  We can hear everything they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.96,0:23:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我们的错！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not our problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不！等等，等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再等一下，  他在打电话而且…我们不能赶他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give us a minute. He's on the phone  and... can't get him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能把他们扔那儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot leave them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有马戏团动物才能上火车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only circus animals on this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.11,0:23:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等，听着！  我们是马戏团的，让我们上来吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, listen! We are circus animals.  You got to let us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的是马戏团的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are really circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是，百分百马戏团的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Full circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈是马戏团的，  我爸爸也是马戏团的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My momma was circus.  My daddy was circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉亚，把门关上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gia! Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了，在那边！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是马戏团的，马戏团要团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are circus. Circus stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇，美帝的马戏团！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Circus americano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.00,0:24:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定很出名！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must all be very famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.07,0:24:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是，我们…  - 当然啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, we...  - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.71,0:24:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相当有名…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're relatively well known...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过亚力克斯是真的大明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Alex is really the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.74,0:24:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是…“大明星”  充其量也是…好吧，明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not... I wouldn't say "star."  More like... well, star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.91,0:24:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力斯，你的绝招是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your act, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…我基本上…嗯，我跳上石头…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... I basically,  uh, I jump up on my rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 石头？  - 对，是一块很高的…石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rock?  - Yeah. It's a very high... rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 超级高！  - 然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A really high rock!  - And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后，我会叫一声，  雄赳赳气昂昂地叫一声“嗷！”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, well, I roar like...  Iike a serious "Rawrrr!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.36,0:24:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后呢？  - 然后我跳下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then?  - And then I jump off the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.93,0:24:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再然后？  - 再…然后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then?!  - And then... And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.47,0:24:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这就完了？  - 跳进水池！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is all?  - lnto a pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.90,0:24:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 满满的一池子水！  - 满满的一池子眼镜蛇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Full of water!  - Full of cobras!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.94,0:24:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实，好像我是跳进…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it appears  like I'm jumping in to a pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.77,0:24:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 眼镜蛇！  - 眼镜水蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With cobras!  - Aquatic cobras.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.77,0:24:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了演出效果起见  紧要时刻我会腾空而起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For effect. But I actually pull up  at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:24:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 腾空而起？  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull up?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么做到的？！  - 用威亚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you do that?!  - Wire harness!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 用气球！  - 用喷气背包！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Balloons!  - Jet pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被威亚吊着，点燃喷气背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I flip off the wire harness,  ignite my jet pack,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.49,0:25:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再把气球扔给全世界的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then toss balloons  to the children of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.29,0:25:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子喜欢，小孩子最喜欢这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids love it. Kids always love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.06,0:25:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是像空中飞人那样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this like the trapeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.13,0:25:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对，飞人！就是这样！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Trapeze! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦！美式空中飞人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Trapeze americano!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.47,0:25:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个好主意，  你们跟我们一起去罗马吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I have a great idea!  Maybe you come with us to Roma!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.54,0:25:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利只是闹着玩，  他很厉害是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Vitaly is just playing around.  He is good, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,额，谢谢，不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, thanks. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们下一站就下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're gonna get off  at the next stop
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要回美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can get back to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太巧了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is such a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们要…我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we're going... going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.89,0:25:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我说完！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.49,0:25:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也要去美国！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to America, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？！  - 美国？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?!  - America?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去美国？  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Going to America?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.83,0:25:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对  - 太好了？什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Si.  - Wow? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.43,0:25:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去完罗马，我们去伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Roma, we go to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.53,0:25:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后有个大赞助商，  会把我们送到纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then a big-time promoter will see us  and then send us to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要去纽约耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:26:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但前提是他要满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, only if he likes what he sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约？真的吗？  那是我们的家，是我们住的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York? Seriously?  That's our home. That's where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是很好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.11,0:26:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们能一起去吗？  - 当然！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could we go with you?  - Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以和维塔利挤一张床！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can bunk with Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哇！  - 不用了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa!  - Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.68,0:26:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.95,0:26:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.19,0:26:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得维塔利不喜欢这个安排，  他要怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Vitaly likes that idea.  What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.33,0:26:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们谁是领头的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one of you is leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你的人，我们这儿有条铁律！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your comrades  there is one rule we do not break!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是说出来，不是喷出来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thou shalt say it and not spray it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.97,0:26:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.37,0:26:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团主人不接纳偷渡者！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus owner no allow stowaways!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.55,0:26:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听见了，俄国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you, Russki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.19,0:26:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此，  马戏团老板如果也是偷渡者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, the circus owner  may allow stowaways
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还是会允许的哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the stowaways  just happen to be the owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddle me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.50,0:27:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只衣着光鲜的小鸟在说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is sharply dressed  little birdie talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.27,0:27:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给他们瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show 'em, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.28,0:27:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交，我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a deal, mi amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.18,0:27:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证这个马戏团会让你大获成功的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sure this circus  will bring you great success!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.39,0:27:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期，祝你好运！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this is good-bye and good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道怎么运营一个马戏团吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we know  about owning a circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.44,0:27:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道，  不过这是我们回家的唯一机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. But it's our only shot  at getting home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.47,0:27:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好知道自己在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可是拿着二等兵的大学基金在冒险啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're risking  Private's community college fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.61,0:27:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都当不了校长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never be president.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.30,0:28:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，这才不是头等舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this is not first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.47,0:28:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是普通舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.32,0:28:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫特，住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mort! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.31,0:29:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.25,0:29:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说过你像超级模特吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anyone ever told you  that you look like a supermodel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.49,0:29:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点胖，毛发有点多，体味有点重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albeit a fat, hairy one who smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一个柔软的背\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a very hairy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.74,0:29:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢这样的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that in a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.41,0:30:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这儿，我要进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.91,0:30:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要！太危险了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.11,0:30:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要逞英雄！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.42,0:30:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,12个小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve hours old.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.09,0:30:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,250公斤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred and fifty kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.43,0:30:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光滑的鬃毛，好多护发素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glossy mane.  Too much conditioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一群白痴！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid bozos!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.11,0:30:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，小猫咪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.68,0:30:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来，你是跟马戏团跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you ran away with the circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.95,0:30:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真没创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a clich?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.38,0:30:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(罗马  700公里)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.78,0:31:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(罗马  0公里)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.95,0:31:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么破地方！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a dump!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.91,0:31:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果想要吸引像样的体育队伍，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they want to attract  a decent sports team,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.68,0:31:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该铲平这老鼠坑，  盖一个新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they should bulldoze this rat trap  and invest in a new arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.29,0:31:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古罗马斗兽场，马蒂！  环形剧场的鼻祖诶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Colosseum, Marty!  The original theater-in-the-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.66,0:31:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的祖先曾经在这里表演  - 真的假的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My ancestors used to perform here.  - No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.67,0:31:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的，每场演出都有俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Every show had  a captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最后都被狮子吃掉了  - 听上去很不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Apparently, they killed.  - Sounds like a great gig!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.20,0:31:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有30分钟！各位！  还有30分钟！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trenta minuti, everybody!  Trenta minuti!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.71,0:31:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太让人激动了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.71,0:31:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住，我们要低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, we just lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离演员远点，不要打扰他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay out of the way.  Let them do their thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来看看这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该回娘胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta go back  in your momma's belly,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.42,0:31:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们太可爱了，都不像三次元世界的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause you're too cute  to be out here in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.65,0:31:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿，滚开，死驴！  - 哇，怎么回…？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oi! Naff off, you muppet!  - Whoa! What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂，他们是专业人士，我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, they're professionals. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.89,0:31:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去好漂亮！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.22,0:31:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了，动物们！  我们是你们的新东家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, animals!  We may be your new owners,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.83,0:32:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不想改变现有的马戏团规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we don't want to reinvent  the circus wheel here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以，上台就按老规矩做！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so just go out, do what you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就当作是为伦敦的赞助商做热身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just think of this as a fun warm-up  for that promoter in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.67,0:32:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧，马蒂，马蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Marty? Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.07,0:32:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想做一匹马戏团的马！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be a circus horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.90,0:32:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把你漆成白色的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could paint you white!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.14,0:32:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把你漆成粉色的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then paint you pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.64,0:32:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 碉堡了！  - 一点都不低调，是吧，马蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Awesome!  - Not laying very low, are we, Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.91,0:32:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅！熊在哪里？  索尼娅！我们要上台了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya! Where is the bear?  Sonya! We're about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.92,0:32:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your game face on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.38,0:32:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笑得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good game face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.75,0:32:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫有病吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that cat's problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“我是个俄罗斯贱猫，看谁都不顺眼”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm a mean Russian cat  who isn't nice to anybody."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.36,0:32:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的，看！我做到了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, honey, look! Look, I'm doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.93,0:32:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.59,0:32:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是找点乐子啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just having a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.76,0:32:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让那些动物好好演出就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's let these animals do their show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒，马戏团！  嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒，爆炸头！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, circus!  Da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, Afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团 爆炸头  马戏团 爆炸头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus Afro  Circus Afro
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花衬衫 花衬衫 花衬衫 爆炸头！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Polka dot, polka dot, polka dot, Afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.71,0:32:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅！索尼娅熊你在哪里？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya! Where is Sonya the bear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.94,0:32:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(梵蒂冈)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.12,0:33:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要吻遍你脸上每一个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to kiss  every inch of your huge head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.66,0:33:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能要花上几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may take me a number of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.33,0:33:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.84,0:33:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要哭，别哭！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cry. Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.61,0:33:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见你哭我也想哭了，亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes me cry  to see you cry, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.28,0:33:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你找辆更好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will get you something even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.94,0:34:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(杜卡迪摩托车)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.62,0:34:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金钱是买的到真爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you can buy love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.19,0:34:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇，别开太快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, not too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由吉亚为大家演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}presenting Gia,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空中飞虎！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the trapeze-flying jaguar!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.17,0:34:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了，向前翻腾三周半，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there she go.  The triple-flip roll
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.17,0:34:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连续跳跃，接着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a double leap, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.94,0:34:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么在这里？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.85,0:34:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是纸做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.95,0:34:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在偷看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you spying on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.85,0:34:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是，我只是顺路过来说一声，  我不希望你觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I just came by to say  that I don't want you to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你觉得我是某种权威人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to think of me  as some sort of authority figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.03,0:34:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别多想，我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.86,0:34:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没有吗？  - 完全没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't?  - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，其他马戏团的动物可能觉得我有点吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the other circus animals  might find me a bit intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.47,0:34:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不，没有人觉得你吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Nobody is intimidated at all by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.74,0:34:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，不错，好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good stuff. Good. Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.31,0:35:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上，我觉得他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I do not think
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.81,0:35:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不把你当回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they have given you a second thought  since you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果非要有点什么，  他们会同情你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything,  they're starting to feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.68,0:35:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好，我明白了，好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I get it. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.38,0:35:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想说什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there more?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.98,0:35:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想谢谢你，让我们上了这列火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to thank you  for letting us get on the train back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.25,0:35:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那个说话带口音的猫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the big cat with the accent...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.59,0:35:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怎么欢迎我们上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wasn't so excited  about us getting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, lion guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.49,0:35:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个马戏团是我们的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This circus means everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你做了任何威胁到马戏团的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you do anything  that threatens this circus,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.20,0:35:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你好看，明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will have to answer to me. Capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白，好  相信我，我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I capisce, cool. Trust me, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.02,0:35:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还低调？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this laying low?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.97,0:36:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点，快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.54,0:36:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有马戏团的地方，就有狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where there is circus, there is lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.21,0:36:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在罗马…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when in Rome...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.25,0:36:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法兰西万岁！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vive la France!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.22,0:36:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.06,0:36:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧，我的毛茸茸女王，  我们去万神殿做甜甜圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, my hairy queen.  We'll do doughnuts in the Pantheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.30,0:36:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你闯大祸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.97,0:36:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你真的闯大…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're really in big troub...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.14,0:36:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你真的闯了非常非常大的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're really, really in big tro...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.14,0:36:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是新来的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm new!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.58,0:36:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好，乐队开始演奏！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK! Strike up the band!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.28,0:36:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有乐队？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a band?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.19,0:36:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着被震撼吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to be blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.49,0:37:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧！  - 走起！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blow me away!  - Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.53,0:37:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧这个！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.73,0:37:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,额…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.67,0:37:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.11,0:37:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦，狗狗很逼真吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! How do dogs do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上真家伙了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.72,0:37:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupido!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这回买票值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was worth  the price of admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.08,0:37:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪位朋友来自辛辛那提？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's from Cincinnati?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.38,0:37:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺，告诉我“震撼”是褒义词，  对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano, you know  "blown away" means good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.98,0:38:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心，高潮要上演了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.  The big finale is coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.65,0:38:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来个节奏！看这儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a downbeat! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，不，不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No, this is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交，我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a deal, mi amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.76,0:38:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒，对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.33,0:38:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去买点吃的再回来吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, go out and get food and come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.62,0:38:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(中场休息)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸，你很开心，事情进展很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep breaths.  You're in a happy place. It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管外面一群民众很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an angry mob outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.35,0:38:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要求退票！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're demanding  their money back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.28,0:38:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们都知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we all know the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快，赶紧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.26,0:38:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快上，赶紧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.76,0:38:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳上火车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop on the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.53,0:38:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快上来，伙计们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈咪呀！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mamma mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.70,0:38:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢，亚力斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grazie, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.04,0:39:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把钱扔给我们就好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just throw us the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.49,0:39:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香塔尔·杜波依队长，起床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Chantal Dubois. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.96,0:39:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将会最高戒备，送您回到摩纳哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to have to send you back  to Monaco under maximum security.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.00,0:39:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.84,0:39:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是枕头！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.44,0:39:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,司令，这是书上最古老的把戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the oldest trick  in the book, Comandante.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.11,0:39:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意大利的小毛头都知道这种把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every bambino in ltaly knows that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.91,0:39:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧，但是小毛头知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, but do they know  about the old escape hole
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.98,0:39:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不起眼的海报后面，  藏着古老的逃生洞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the innocent-looking poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.69,0:39:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者，真正古老的“躲在天花板上”！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the really old "I'm gonna  hide up on the ceiling" trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.20,0:39:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有床底下的秘密隧道！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret tunnel under the bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把床挪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this thing out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们下去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.21,0:40:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个秘密隧道是死胡同！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This secret tunnel is a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.48,0:40:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了弹簧和床垫，什么都没有！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing but bedsprings  and mattress stuffing down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.15,0:40:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是关门的声音吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that the sound  of a cell door closing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voil?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.93,0:40:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的惠普打印机的声音吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that the sound  of my HP printer printing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.03,0:40:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(中央公园动物园的明星狮子仍杳无音讯)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.51,0:40:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是场灾难！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.41,0:40:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的钱都花在了烂马戏团上，  却都没有离纽约近一丁点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We blow all our money on a bad circus,  and we're not any closer to New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.75,0:40:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕是越来越远了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything, we're further away!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.35,0:40:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们至少应该买一个会表演的马戏团！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have at least bought a circus  that knew how to circ!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道一开始为什么要买下它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know why we bought  a circus in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的钱都够用来买飞机了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had enough dough for a plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.39,0:40:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.39,0:40:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定还有钱没花完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have some money left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.06,0:41:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花钱装了假牙，还镀了层金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used it to buy teeth  and then have them capped in gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.43,0:41:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我就能吃苹果了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I can eat apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.77,0:41:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜，我发现我不喜欢吃苹果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadly, I discovered I don't like apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人会赞助这支马戏团去美国，  完结了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No promoter is sending this show  to America. It's toe up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在说得通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.21,0:41:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得马戏团老板巴不得卖掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder the circus master  was so happy to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.28,0:41:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当然开心，烂摊子都甩给我们了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was happy, all right.  Happy about ripping us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯去哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did Alex go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.30,0:41:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快过来，这里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.30,0:41:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不，你过来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.81,0:41:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力斯，小心头！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, watch your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.22,0:41:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.76,0:42:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.10,0:42:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.00,0:42:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.17,0:42:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是美式飞人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that trapeze americano?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.41,0:42:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,额，算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.57,0:42:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.61,0:42:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望是重要的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.11,0:42:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走，亚力斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come this way, Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.11,0:42:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,额，是“克斯”不是“斯”，  亚力克斯，和纽约尼克斯一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, it's "icks" not "iss".  Alex. Like New York Knicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.68,0:42:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道，纽约尼斯嘛，发音不难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. New York Kniss. Is not hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.09,0:42:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.37,0:42:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.13,0:42:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们觉得我们是一只烂马戏团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you think we are  a stinky, poopy circus,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.00,0:42:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我得告诉你些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there is something you must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.87,0:42:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们萨拉戈萨马戏团，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a time  when Circus Zaragoza,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.44,0:42:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一度是一支伟大的马戏团！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were a great circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.21,0:42:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧罗巴所有马戏团排名第一！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Numero uno in all the Europa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.05,0:43:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而维塔利…他是我们中最闪亮的明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Vitaly...  he was the biggest star of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.72,0:43:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他无所畏惧，敢于冒险，总是有新把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was fearless.  Taking risks. Always new.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.89,0:43:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跳起来能飞一样穿过铁环！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He jump through the hoop  like he could fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.17,0:43:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.47,0:43:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿个小点的环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the hoop smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.54,0:43:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.68,0:43:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再小点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.18,0:43:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这样？  - 行！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like this?  - Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.60,0:43:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个可谓前无古人，  因为物理上根本不可能！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had never been done before  because it was physically impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.44,0:43:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而观众…他们超喜欢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the people... they loved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.67,0:43:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利万岁！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viva Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.17,0:43:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再小点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.09,0:44:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,环，就越变越小！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the hoop, she got smaller!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.46,0:44:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是豌豆公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.69,0:44:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那纤细的手指上的戒指一样大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a finger of the tiniest lady  with the slimmest of fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了，维塔利！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.13,0:44:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从未停止过挑战自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would not stop pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.30,0:44:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于有一天…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one fateful day...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.30,0:44:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…太过了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he push too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.41,0:44:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点火！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light the hoop on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.00,0:44:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他太过靠近太阳…最终烧伤了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fly too close to the sun...  and he got burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.67,0:45:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的烧伤，他身上的橄榄油特别易燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally. The extra virgin olive oil  is extra flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.01,0:45:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他失去了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.01,0:45:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的妻子，跟一个音乐家跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His wife, she run off with a musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.41,0:45:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的尊严…他的荣耀…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lost his dignity... his fame...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.95,0:45:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…他的热情…还有他的毛发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his passion... and his fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新长出来的毛没以前那么软了，  更像是扎人的胡须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when it grow back, it is less soft.  More like a prickly beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.19,0:45:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，维塔利！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scusi. Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.83,0:45:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我没说！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.53,0:45:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在唯一的兴趣就是罗宋汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His only passion now is the borscht.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.70,0:45:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.97,0:45:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经是我们的中流砥柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was our inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.27,0:45:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以当他热情不再，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when he lost his passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.14,0:45:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团也每况愈下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well... as Vitaly goes,  so goes the circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.88,0:45:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因而我们需要你们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.05,0:45:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的帮助？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of help?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.15,0:45:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以教我们新的马戏，美式马戏！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can teach us to do new circus.  Americano style!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.18,0:45:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找回激情，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find a new passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.65,0:45:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来场全新的演出，直达美！利！坚！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a new show.  And we go all the way to US and A!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.57,0:46:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，这是个白痴的点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. It is stupido idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.37,0:46:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是败军之将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.41,0:46:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不，这个点子不错，行得通！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, this isn't stupido.  This could work!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 你刚刚说的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - What you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.58,0:46:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 你刚出的主意啊，两秒钟之前那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - The idea you said. Two seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.38,0:46:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 你那个白痴的点子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Your stupido idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以吗？  - 斯蒂芬诺，你是天才！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It could?  - Stefano, you're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.55,0:46:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不，我只是一般聪明啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no.  I am only average intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.86,0:46:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人说我比一般聪明再笨一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some say I'm even slightly below.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要重新考虑马戏团现有的节目！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are gonna rethink everything  anybody's ever known about circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.16,0:46:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我称为计划4-7B\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call it Phase 4-7B,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.60,0:46:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据计划，为了回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wherein, in order to get home,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.83,0:46:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要创造些新的东西，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will come up with something fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一些新奇的，崭新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something amazing,  something brand-new!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.11,0:46:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜的，前所未有的，非比寻常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh, never before seen!  Off the chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.54,0:46:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会震撼到马戏团赞助商的东西！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that'll blow  that circus promoter away!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.11,0:46:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,歪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.18,0:46:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 砍掉你的头！  - 我咬下他的腿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Off with your head!  - I'm gonna chew his leg off!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.22,0:47:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团代代相传就是那样的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus has been same for generations!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们创作优秀经典的家庭娱乐，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make good,  classic family entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但上几代人，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But last few generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.79,0:47:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“家庭”…不怎么喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}families... not so entertained.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.80,0:47:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是这样，一家子都不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.  Families not so entertained
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.30,0:47:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你们的表演像是走过场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're just going  through the motions out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.04,0:47:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有激情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's missing passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.11,0:47:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“虎子”都戳到脸上了，  还怎么激情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How one to have passion  for stool poked in face?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.91,0:47:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是！你说的“虎子”是指凳子，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly! And by stool  you mean chair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.48,0:47:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们太拘泥于现状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is, you guys,  you got stuck in a rut.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.82,0:47:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再挑战自己，不再勇于冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stopped pushing,  you stopped taking risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.79,0:47:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就让那些日子成为历史吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.55,0:47:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在，我们要彻底改变表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because now we're going  to completely change the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.76,0:47:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就不是马戏团了，不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it wouldn't be a circus, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.56,0:47:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团无关乎表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus is not about the acts you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.56,0:47:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团关乎于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.27,0:47:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么弗莱迪能得到所有的马戏团？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come Freddie gets all the circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.67,0:47:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团在于激情所向，不论你去哪里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus is about following your passions,  wherever they take you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.01,0:47:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能改变马戏团，  它有着悠久的历史！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot change circus.  There is long tradition!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.81,0:47:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家曾经都是这么想的，维塔利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what everybody thought, Vitaly,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.78,0:48:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到那些法裔加拿大人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until those French Canadians  came along,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.15,0:48:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝着枫糖浆，使用廉价药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drunk off their maple syrup  and cheap pharmaceuticals,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.35,0:48:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彻底地颠覆了传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and completely flipped the paradigm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.69,0:48:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们在拉斯维加斯表演  52个不同的舞台，每天演50场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they play Vegas.  Fifty shows a day in 52 separate venues.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.03,0:48:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中有个人还是全裸表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of them  completely in the nude.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.29,0:48:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对，说的没错，你知道怎么做到的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.  And you know how they did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.33,0:48:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off their clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.70,0:48:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不，他们抛弃了所有动物  - 你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. They got rid of the animals.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.30,0:48:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快说不是这样的！  - 他们白痴吗，不要动物…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say it ain't so!  - Che stupida! No animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.71,0:48:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么能这样？！  - 好了，知道我怎么想吗！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How could they?!  - Well, you know what I say to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.01,0:48:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说，他们能把动物赶出马戏团，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say they can take  the animals out of the circus,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.44,0:48:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不能把他们从马戏团名单上划走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they cannot take  the animals out of the circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.22,0:48:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说，他们不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, they cannot...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.69,0:48:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们懂的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you understand what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是！  - 懂！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah!  - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.99,0:48:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.16,0:48:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经有激情了，  我们才不需要人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need humans  because we've got passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.56,0:48:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人有激情的时候，他会说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does a human say  when he's passionate?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.46,0:48:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会说“我是一头野兽！”，  而我们就是野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says, "I'm an animal!"  Well, we are animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.07,0:48:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要打造一支全动物的马戏团！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make an all-animal circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.97,0:49:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果我们心随意动，我们将无所不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if we follow our passion,  we can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.38,0:49:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 无所不能！  - 所向无敌！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anywhere!  - We can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.68,0:49:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 无所不能！  - 只要我们团结起来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything!  - If we do it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们一起！  - 好…太好了，赞成！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All of us!  - Yeah... Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.42,0:49:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们自己的马戏团！  - 耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our circus!  - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.25,0:49:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们加入，我们就这么做！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in! We'll have some of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.76,0:49:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大声点，“野兽力量”！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I hear you say "fur power"?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.26,0:49:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,野兽力量！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fur power!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重新开张，齐心协力！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take our circus back,  and we'll do it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.83,0:49:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你，宝贝，我们一起！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, baby! An act together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.53,0:49:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.53,0:49:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一起跳爵士舞！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do  that funk and groove dance thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跳舞？  - 是啊，就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dance?  - This thing right here. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.20,0:49:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你，我们可以的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and you! We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.11,0:49:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.41,0:49:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,野兽力量！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fur power!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.84,0:49:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喊口号真好玩！喊口号真好玩！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chanting is fun! Chanting is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.88,0:49:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信任这个狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not trust this lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.55,0:49:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利，我也不怎么相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vitaly, I may not trust him, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.22,0:49:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但干坐着，干站着，  滚来滚去这套，我实在是烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am tired of sitting  and standing and rolling over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.56,0:49:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是都是优秀的传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is great tradition  of sitting, standing, rolling over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.43,0:49:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们的马戏团有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know our circus is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.90,0:50:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是我们最后的机会了，  但我们不能没有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be our last chance.  But we will not do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.30,0:50:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团总是团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus always stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.65,0:50:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，我试试，就钻一次环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. I do one hoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.65,0:50:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要抱一下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a hug, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.84,0:50:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意！我找到狮子了，他躲在马戏团里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention! I have found our lion!  He is hiding with the circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.16,0:52:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来，莫瑞斯（其实在叫马蒂），给我吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maurice, give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.12,0:52:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多加点火药，理科！  我真的很想飞起来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More boomstick, Rico!  I really want to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.16,0:52:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的要把自己射出去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you really going  to shoot yourself out of that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.53,0:52:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从我还小的时候，我就憧憬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always dreamed of doing this,  from time I was a little pup,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.04,0:52:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为一枚人肉炮弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be a human cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.54,0:52:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是，你懂的…海狮炮弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except, you know...  a sea lion cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.37,0:52:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很危险吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.78,0:52:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,危险？当然危险！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it dangerous?  Yes, of course it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.61,0:52:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这样你还要做？  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, are you sure about this?  - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.18,0:52:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是“震撼”是你的座右铭，你来对地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if blowing up is your thing,  then you in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.22,0:52:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是，没错！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Si. That's means yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.29,0:52:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备发射？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.76,0:52:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.46,0:52:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开火！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.31,0:53:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mamma mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.24,0:53:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.78,0:53:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里科！准备好炮弹！同样的动力！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico! Get the cannon ready!  Same charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.68,0:53:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开火！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.00,0:53:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.75,0:53:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.92,0:53:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂！太好了，你在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.69,0:53:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在飞！我真的在弗诶飞！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was flying! I was effin'-L-Y-in'!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.10,0:53:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真为你开心，但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.10,0:53:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…我就要支撑不住了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don't think  I can hold on much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.97,0:54:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好，没问题，不好意思我太高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, right.  Sorry about my enthusiasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.77,0:54:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住绳子，套身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, wrap this around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.94,0:54:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事没事，我抓着呢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I got you! I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.19,0:54:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘掉自己是蹄类吧！我快成为鸟类了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about being part of the herd!  I'm gonna be part of the flock!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.79,0:54:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会飞了耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to fly, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.76,0:54:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊！成了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes! What a triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 交出马戏团来，弗莱迪！  - 我扯掉你肠子当吊带！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hand over that circus, Freddie!  - I'll have your guts for garters!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.83,0:54:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿，放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, put your weapons down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一下，伙计们，  装可爱显然不是你们的强项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, chill out. Cute and cuddly's  obviously not your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.81,0:54:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说到点子上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got us pegged.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.24,0:54:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个更好的主意，给他们看看，里科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a better idea. Show 'em, Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.05,0:54:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.35,0:54:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 滑板！  - 火箭鞋！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flippin' 'eck!  - Rocket shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.39,0:54:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想穿穿看！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to try that!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.59,0:54:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯，乔纳斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonesy! Jonesy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.36,0:54:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.59,0:54:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,激将法用得真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire how you  have inspired these animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.99,0:54:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.06,0:55:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你谈论激情的时候，像在读诗一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what you said about passion,  it was like poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.43,0:55:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢激情和诗歌，它们其实是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love passion and poetry.  They go together, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.43,0:55:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不押韵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know they don't rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空中飞人是我的热情所在！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trapeze is my passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.37,0:55:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了，期待看到你表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrific. I look forward  to seeing you up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.04,0:55:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以教我啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can teach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.67,0:55:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 教我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.11,0:55:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,额，我一直是单独表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've always  been kind of a solo act.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.04,0:55:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以规则不一样啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that kind of rules that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.78,0:55:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想，你是不是真的会空中飞人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if you actually do trapeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.88,0:55:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦，我真的会  - 让我瞧瞧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I actually do do trapeze.  - Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.95,0:55:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“让我瞧瞧”？我们还是五岁小孩么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Show me"? What are we, five?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.29,0:55:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊，我就是五岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am five, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.29,0:55:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.96,0:55:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要动动脚就好，哪儿都不要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you're doing is moving  and not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.86,0:55:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,音乐让我太过忘我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the music  totally throws off my timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.56,0:55:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来点刺激的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want excitement?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.30,0:55:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁在钢丝上，哼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out. Who's on a tightrope, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.07,0:55:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's on a...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.07,0:55:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在钢丝绳上！我在钢丝绳上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on a tightrope!  I'm on a tightrope!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.97,0:55:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼，我的天啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melman! Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.44,0:55:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救我！  - 亲爱的，坚持住，坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me!  - Baby, hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.24,0:55:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.72,0:55:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔曼？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.59,0:56:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静，梅尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.92,0:56:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要掉下去摔断脖子了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to fall  and break all of my neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.26,0:56:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我，看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.99,0:56:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 全神贯注看着我  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All eyes on me.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.16,0:56:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来这边  - 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come to me.  - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.27,0:56:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像跳舞一样，梅尔曼，进两步，退一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just like dancing, Melman.  Two steps forward, one step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.34,0:56:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会跳舞，知道吗？我说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't dance, OK? There, I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.94,0:56:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为你没试过呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe because you've never tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.64,0:56:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I have tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.94,0:56:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你跳得太好，我私下偷偷练习来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I practiced in private  because you dance so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.15,0:56:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你练过了？为了我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You practiced? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.95,0:56:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是，但是没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.92,0:56:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我的手要怎么放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never know  what to do with my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.32,0:56:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.82,0:56:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那部分很简单的，梅尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That part is so easy, Melman. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.49,0:56:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要把手放在舞伴身上就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause all you have to do  is put them around your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.03,0:56:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见吗，进两步？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Two steps forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.97,0:56:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.80,0:56:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我在跳舞，我在跳舞！  - 进两步…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm dancing. I'm dancing!  - Two steps forward...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.64,0:56:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们在钢丝上跳舞！  - 你跳得很好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're dancing on a tightrope!  - You're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.71,0:56:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能跳舞了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.21,0:56:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.21,0:57:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.48,0:57:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候用上喷气背包和眼镜水蛇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when do we get  the jet packs and aquatic cobras?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.98,0:57:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这节是初级课，那些太高级了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a beginners' class,  and that's a pretty advanced maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.85,0:57:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好，怎么开始？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, how do we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.19,0:57:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来有点复杂，除非你搞清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit complicated  unless you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.52,0:57:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这整个装置和脚…角度还有重力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the whole pitch and yaw...  arc and gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.06,0:57:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西，肯定会让你无聊的，肯定会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that stuff,  which I won't bore you with. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.33,0:57:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要我推一下吗？  - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you need a push?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.00,0:57:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着学就行了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just watch and learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.68,0:57:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦，这是一种方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one way of doing it, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.59,0:57:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用了网！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You use a net!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.23,0:57:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是！美式飞人，我们用网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Trapeze americano. We use the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.27,0:57:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美式飞人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trapeze americano!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.59,0:58:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快看他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.80,0:58:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.11,0:58:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了，鼓掌！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E bravo! Bravissima!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.65,0:58:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利，你想不想多钻一次环？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Vitaly,  maybe you even do two hoops, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.82,0:58:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疯女人，拉响警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senorita, Bell-bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.66,0:58:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇上大问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tenemos una problema grande.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.13,0:58:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大，大问题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Que? Que? Grande problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.40,0:59:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不，她要找到我们了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! She's onto us!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.10,0:59:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要把那个疯子引过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make it any easier on the psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.34,0:59:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们怎么办？  - 我们最好赶紧离开，赶紧准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are we gonna do?  - We'd better vamoose... pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.24,0:59:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还没结束呢，还在排练当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not ready.  We're in the middle of rehearsals.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.51,0:59:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就哼哼小曲儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why don't you lilt over,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.98,0:59:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摘摘小花儿，跟纽约吻别吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grab your peduncle,  and kiss New York good-bye?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.75,0:59:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure we are ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.52,0:59:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦，早就准备好了！  准备得太好了！来吧，我们走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course we're ready! Born ready!  Ready steady! Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发！我们走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.79,0:59:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，你们听到那只猫的话了，  走吧，来！启程！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you heard the cat.  Move it! Come on! All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.69,0:59:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带好行李，上好厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your luggage  and drain your bladders.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.83,0:59:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这将是漫长的旅程！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be a long ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.70,0:59:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦，我们来震撼赞助商吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everybody,  let's blow that promoter away!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.47,0:59:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伦敦，我们来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.04,0:59:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阳光明媚的伦敦！我们来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunshiny London, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.36,1:00:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利，维塔利，维塔利！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vitaly! Vitaly! Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.67,1:00:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.99,1:00:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点，快点，他在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.  Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.07,1:00:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.67,1:00:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果此人不是精力充沛的赞助商，  我不知道还能是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's not a red-blooded  American promoter, I don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.40,1:00:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要踏踏实实做好演出，  二等兵！告诉他们飞鹰已着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get this show on the road.  Private! Tell them the eagle has landed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.07,1:00:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞鹰已着陆！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eagle has landed!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.58,1:00:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了，盯好杜波依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.  And keep an eye out for Dubois.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.24,1:00:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到，老大！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, aye, guvnor!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.25,1:00:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赞助商在场！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The promoter is in the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.81,1:00:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约近在咫尺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York is closer than ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.45,1:00:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别高兴太早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.72,1:00:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们首先要表演好马戏，上场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we got a circus to do.  We're on, folks!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.09,1:01:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们在狗狗之前还是之后上场？  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do we go on before or after the dogs?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.69,1:01:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 一起，你们一起上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Overlap, your acts overlap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维塔利在哪儿？他开场  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Vitaly? He opens.  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.36,1:01:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺！嘿，斯蒂芬诺！  你看到维塔利了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano! Hey, Stefano!  Have you seen Vitaly?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.96,1:01:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺，伤心什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano, why the sad little face?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.04,1:01:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利…他不会上场了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vitaly... he will not go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.90,1:01:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.91,1:01:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried everything I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.04,1:01:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擦干眼泪，冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wipe away the tears. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.68,1:01:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿？我可以说服他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?  I'm sure I can reason with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.05,1:01:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维塔利，你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vitaly, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.25,1:01:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打歪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.55,1:01:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要走？你就这么放弃大家了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're leaving? You're just gonna  walk out on everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.82,1:01:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我，你们的表演一样很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have good show without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.73,1:01:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着，我左脚很健康，  但是没有右脚，我就走不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I got a good left foot,  but without my right foot, I can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.06,1:01:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装个假肢你就能走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get fake foot, then you walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.73,1:01:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不装假肢，好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want fake foot! OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.30,1:01:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“马戏团团结在一起”这句是空话么，  “一直演下去”呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to "circus stick  together"? "The show must go on".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.97,1:01:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是老掉牙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cliches.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.57,1:01:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托，我不要这个维塔利！  我要另一个维塔利！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.  Stop being this guy! Be the other guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.81,1:01:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么另一个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个是马戏团的中流砥柱的你！  那个穿过铁环的你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy who was all circus!  The guy who jumped through hoops!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.35,1:02:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回归那个你！那个受到大家的景仰的你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that!  The guy everybody looked up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.32,1:02:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个维塔利在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Where's that Vitaly?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.16,1:02:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Vitaly is no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，你可以自暴自弃，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, man.  You may have given up on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你的朋友从来没放弃过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your friends  haven't given up on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.00,1:02:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想在余生，转过身去背对他们，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you just going  to turn your back on them,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.60,1:02:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人默默喝一辈子罗宋汤？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sit and eat borscht  the rest of your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.61,1:02:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是，你现在走出去，  上台穿过那个小小的铁环？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you gonna get out there  and jump through that tiny little hoop?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.68,1:02:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.62,1:02:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为不可能，维塔利，所以人们才喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always impossible, Vitaly.  That's why the people loved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.46,1:02:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我也喜欢的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I loved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.30,1:02:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我做到了不可能的事情！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I did the impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.80,1:02:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经是个勇敢的老虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was once a brave tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.64,1:03:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在火焰中倒下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I go down in flames...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.97,1:03:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…又算得了什么！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so be it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.81,1:03:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也许可以帮你出个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I think  I might have an idea for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.09,1:03:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(护发素)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点火吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light the hoop on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.51,1:03:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈咪呀，圣母保佑，圣母保佑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mamma mia, Santa Maria, Santa Maria...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.55,1:03:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈咪呀，圣母保佑，圣子保佑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mamma Maria, mia Santa,  Santa Mia Farrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.96,1:03:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油，你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.10,1:04:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.81,1:04:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了，还愣着干嘛？  我们有演出呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, what are you waiting for?  We got a show to put on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.25,1:04:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上场，出发！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.07,1:04:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.38,1:06:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去美国啦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to America!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.85,1:06:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.28,1:06:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所说的当梦想照进现实！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I call crack-a-lackin'  to the mack-a-lackin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.12,1:06:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们做到了，亚力斯！  - 是啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We did it, Alice!  - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.79,1:06:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我还是有一般聪明的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I am  average intelligence after all!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.12,1:06:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有可能还略高于一般聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps even slightly above.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.29,1:06:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我不觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.46,1:06:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,护发素，好想法啊，兄弟！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hair conditioner. Great idea, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.63,1:06:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸摸看，快，小猫一样软，是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel. Go ahead. Soft like kitten, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.30,1:06:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.87,1:06:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又滑又不易燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slippery but not flammable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.07,1:06:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你闻上去有桃子和青草的味道！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smell like peaches and herb!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.87,1:06:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉亚和亚力克斯，空中飞猫！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gia and Alex, the trapezing cats!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.14,1:07:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.61,1:07:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你空翻，我来接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will flip, and I will catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.41,1:07:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我空翻，你来接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sometimes I will flip,  and you will catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.71,1:07:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们俩一起空翻，  我们能世界巡演了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we will both flip,  and we'll travel the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.65,1:07:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旋转跳跃，我闭着眼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flipping and catching,  and I will flip you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.23,1:07:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道，其实…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.00,1:07:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会一直呆这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not always be around.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.93,1:07:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去那儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.00,1:07:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm... I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.84,1:07:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好嘛，很好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.01,1:07:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是温暖人心的表演，  马戏团老板先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a heartwarming performance,  Monsieur Circus Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.84,1:07:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看得我热泪盈眶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brought tears to my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.51,1:07:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不，骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.78,1:07:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生，我们都知道，狮子不属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur, we both know  the lion does not belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.62,1:07:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个怪女人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that horrid woman!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是警察局的逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a fugitive from justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.29,1:07:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把狮子交给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will turn the lion over to me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.13,1:07:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我可以送他去该去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that I may put him  where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.63,1:07:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挂在我墙上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.37,1:08:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？  - 入！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - lncoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.21,1:08:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outgoing!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.45,1:08:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.85,1:08:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,击掌！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up high!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.22,1:08:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太低，太慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down low. Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.89,1:08:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 干得好，二等兵  - 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well done, Private.  - Did I do good?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.66,1:08:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.99,1:08:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好险啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.90,1:08:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.86,1:08:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是动物园来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are from a zoo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.40,1:08:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是，不过等等，不只是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes. But wait, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.14,1:08:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不只？  - 或是不全是，不全是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- More?  - Or less. There's less.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.94,1:08:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没待过马戏团？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were never circus?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.08,1:08:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不说自己是从马戏团来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to say we were circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.18,1:08:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然你们都不让我们上车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you'd never have let us on the train!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.98,1:08:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我们一起奋斗过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all we have  been through together...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.59,1:08:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…你想回去住动物园吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you want to go live in a zoo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.26,1:08:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉亚，我…  - 你利用了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gia, l...  - You used us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.32,1:08:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不，我是说，是的，但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. I mean, yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.86,1:09:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美式飞人，这也是编出来的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trapeze americano,  you make that up, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.40,1:09:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我教你的时候其实没有这个把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't exactly exist  when I taught it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.03,1:09:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喷气背包和眼镜水蛇！  我早该知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jet packs and aquatic cobras!  I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.53,1:09:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给孩子的气球也不是真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balloons to the children of the world  was not real, either?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.77,1:09:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，不是真的，但是看看我们做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's not real.  But look at what we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.07,1:09:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被一门大炮射出去！  差点死掉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was shot out of a cannon!  I could have died!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.45,1:09:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为这是你毕生梦想呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought it was  your lifelong dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.95,1:09:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说，亚力斯都不是你的真名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all I know,  your name is not even Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是，斯蒂芬诺，确实不是这么叫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Stefano, but it never really was.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.86,1:09:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没有安全感了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.19,1:09:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉亚，我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gia, l...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.63,1:09:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们信任过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.30,1:09:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼泪是真的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My tears are real!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.90,1:09:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.21,1:09:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信，  你欺骗了我们一马戏团的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you lied  to all us circus folk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.15,1:09:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我？留在马戏团？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Stay with the circus?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.65,1:10:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是帝王之命！我要统治纽约！  我们应该好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a king! I want to rule New York!  We should talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.22,1:10:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.19,1:10:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手！说不行就不行，用你的话说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! No means no!  Or in your language...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.93,1:10:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这解决不了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everything  is solved that way, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.01,1:10:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅，你在听我说吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya? Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.84,1:10:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我被冷暴力了，是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm getting  the silent treatment, am l?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.35,1:10:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来，立刻马上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come over here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.68,1:10:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shut me out, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.79,1:10:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了啊！说话啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is wrong with you? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.52,1:10:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧…如果你的感情只是这样，我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK... if these are your feelings,  I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.33,1:10:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走就是了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.16,1:10:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我只是你人生中不起眼的一小部份！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's obvious I'm just an emotional  whoopee cushion for you to sit on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.97,1:10:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以后想找我，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you look for where I am,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.10,1:10:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也找不到了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be there!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.34,1:11:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约城)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.53,1:11:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧，各位，我们还有表演要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, everybody.  We have show to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.30,1:11:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是没有马蒂，我要怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how do I go on without Marty?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.67,1:11:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯蒂芬诺  - 我不知道怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stefano.  - I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.67,1:11:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是可以表演单人炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can still do cannon solo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.14,1:11:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是…我想跟马蒂一起做单人表演！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... I want to do solo act with Marty!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.25,1:11:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么办呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.05,1:11:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重新回到坐下，起立，翻滚嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to sitting  and standing and rolling over?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.55,1:11:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.19,1:11:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以做不可能的事情！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.76,1:11:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且，我们不要重归平淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we never go back  to way we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.16,1:11:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,平淡不是以前的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way it used to be  isn't the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.67,1:11:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他们什么都变了，  干什么不都一样么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it won't be the same without them,  whatever way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.31,1:12:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(中央公园动物园)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.26,1:12:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了，我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.73,1:12:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.23,1:12:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得我的石头没这么小的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My rock looks smaller  than I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看那张壁画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the mural.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.57,1:12:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不像，是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't actually capture  the real thing, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.91,1:12:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.75,1:12:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了我们之间还有一堵墙了，  梅尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot about that wall  in between us, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.82,1:12:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that always there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.09,1:12:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们，对不起，我从一开始就不该离开动物园的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I'm sorry  I ever left the zoo in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.93,1:12:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.60,1:13:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说，如果我乖乖待着不动，\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if I had just stayed put,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.60,1:13:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就不会难过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we wouldn't have  anything to be sad about right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.84,1:13:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开动物园是做过的最棒的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving the zoo was the best thing  that ever happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.78,1:13:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.28,1:13:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，在外面广阔的世界里，  我们才真正地活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Out there, in the world,  we were really living.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.48,1:13:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊！  - 很有趣！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah!  - It was exciting!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.02,1:13:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很浪漫  - 很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was romantic.  - It was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.32,1:13:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有这么活着过！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never felt so alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.99,1:13:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们进马戏团的时候，我们就已经回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we were with the circus,  we were already home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.29,1:13:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我早点能认识到这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wish we'd realized that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.80,1:13:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想那些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really going to miss those guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.33,1:13:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得，我们回去怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say we go back?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.30,1:13:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.30,1:13:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也要回去！  - 我也要！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm with you!  - I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.70,1:13:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要怎么跟他们说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what do we tell them?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.37,1:13:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟他们认错就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make it right by telling them  how wrong we were.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.51,1:13:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,值得一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.51,1:13:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在火焰中倒下，又算得了什么！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we go down in flames, so be it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.88,1:13:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好，就这么干！  - 我赞成！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, let's do this!  - I like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.55,1:13:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好，我们回去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.82,1:13:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的脖子变长了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is my neck getting longer?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.35,1:13:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸摸看我的毛，好软啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel my fur. It's so soft.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.49,1:13:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is soft.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.22,1:14:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就像黑白片里的甘蔗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like a candy cane  in a black and white movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.96,1:14:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.83,1:14:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杜波依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dubois.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.50,1:14:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅，我想你了！宝贝！  我想你了，你这臭臭的熊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya, I miss you, baby!  I miss my stinky bear!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.97,1:14:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝…你湿湿的吻！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe... your fishy kisses!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.51,1:14:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.21,1:14:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他塞不进行李箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will never fit in the carry-on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.75,1:14:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他的头可以！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his head will!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿！  - 什么人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey!  - Qu'est-ce Que c'est?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.09,1:14:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看，看看她做了什么！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Look what she's done!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.49,1:14:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把亚力克斯带回来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought back Alex the lion!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.59,1:14:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奇迹啊  - 谢谢，谢谢！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a miracle!  - Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.53,1:14:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅，你在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.36,1:14:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.26,1:14:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.23,1:14:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,索尼娅宝贝！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonya, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.74,1:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要当王了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be king anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.77,1:14:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去太在乎我是谁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so hung up on who I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.37,1:14:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…你是谁…和你的味道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who you was...  what you smelled like...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.11,1:14:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…重要的是我们俩一起臭味相投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when all that really matters  is what we smell like together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.95,1:15:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.45,1:15:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝，原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.29,1:15:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.89,1:15:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是杜波依！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gasp! It's Dubois!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.29,1:15:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baba booey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.29,1:15:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这哪儿来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.59,1:15:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动物园来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it from the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.73,1:15:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那群人中了埋伏了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hippies got ambushed!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.76,1:15:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？我们必须要帮他们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? We have to help them!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们骗了我们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they lied to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.17,1:15:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，我们为什么还要伸出援手？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Why should we lift a paw?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.87,1:15:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我们的朋友！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are our friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.54,1:15:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都不是马戏团的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not even circus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.47,1:15:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布尔什维克该站在一起！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Bolshevik!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.97,1:15:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没想过在美国大地上说出这样的话，  但俄国佬说得对！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I'd say this  on American soil, but the Russki's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.95,1:15:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯，亚力克斯，亚力克斯，亚力克斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex! Alex! Alex! Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.66,1:15:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.76,1:15:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.06,1:15:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.63,1:15:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格洛丽亚！你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloria! Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.76,1:15:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发生了什么？  - 亚力克斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is happening?  - Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.63,1:15:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不不！不不！  - 亚力克狮！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no! No, no!  - Alex the lion!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.93,1:15:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.18,1:16:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢，谢谢大家来参加这项特殊的庆典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you all for coming  to this special celebration.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.78,1:16:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在，创造奇迹的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the woman  who made this all possible,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.98,1:16:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她带了亚力克狮和其他两个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who brought Alex the lion  and a couple of...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.32,1:16:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…三个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.82,1:16:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他三个动物回到了纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three other animals back to New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.42,1:16:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's French.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.83,1:16:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们欢迎香塔尔·杜波依！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please welcome Chantal Dubois!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.33,1:16:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.64,1:17:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是钱的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never about the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.57,1:17:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was about...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.48,1:17:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.42,1:17:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉亚？  - 马戏团团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gia?  - Circus stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.73,1:17:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒，马戏团  嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒，爆炸头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, circus  Da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, Afro
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.40,1:17:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团 爆炸头，马戏团 爆炸头  花衬衫，花衬衫！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus Afro, Circus Afro  Polka dot, polka dot!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.23,1:17:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看！会飞的马戏团！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! A flying circus!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.44,1:17:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.04,1:17:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,营救马戏团小组…汇合！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Afro-Circus Rescue... engage!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.94,1:17:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命，老大！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, aye, Skipper!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.61,1:17:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射海豹炮弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unleash the seal.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.28,1:17:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是海狮！  - 随便啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am a sea lion!  - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.96,1:17:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大象坠落，冲啊冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two tons of fun. Dive, dive, dive!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.47,1:18:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.57,1:18:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你，亲爱的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.72,1:18:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.50,1:18:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收个小腹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck in that gut!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.27,1:18:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am impressed!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.48,1:18:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务完成，现在我们离开这里吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission accomplished.  Now let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.58,1:18:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等，等我！  - 斯蒂芬诺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! Wait for me!  - Stefano!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.02,1:18:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要丢下我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave without me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.49,1:19:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.87,1:19:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑，斯蒂芬诺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Stefano!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.10,1:19:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爬上来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.48,1:19:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.01,1:19:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂芬诺！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stefano!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.11,1:19:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.48,1:19:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会收着你的脑袋的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.69,1:19:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要！救我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.22,1:19:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.03,1:19:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马蒂！把我射出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty! Shoot me a line.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.83,1:19:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的，哥们，别往我失望啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it. Afro, don't fail me now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.04,1:19:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.24,1:19:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来美式空中飞人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are doing trapeze americano.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.91,1:19:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.68,1:19:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 弗兰基！乔纳斯！准备好了！  - 随时待命，长官！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Frankie, Jonesy! Be ready!  - You got it, boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.85,1:19:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.09,1:20:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉亚，带斯蒂芬诺走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gia! Take Stefano!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.26,1:20:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚力克斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.41,1:20:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜水蛇！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aquatic cobras!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.78,1:20:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我掉下去，你的头要陪葬！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I am going down,  your head is coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.11,1:20:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休想！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.38,1:20:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我们了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.18,1:20:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己掉下去吧，恕不奉陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down,  but not with my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.56,1:20:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喷气背包！他腾空了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jet pack! He pull up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.93,1:20:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你滥捕动物的日子到头了，杜波依！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your days of chasing animals  are over, Dubois!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.89,1:20:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你惹到百兽之王了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you've just messed  with the king!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.61,1:21:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动物们希望你待在这儿！  现在，坐下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where animals like you belong!  Now sit!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.58,1:21:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.75,1:21:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好调皮呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naughty me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.91,1:21:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚几圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.05,1:21:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错嘛，杜波依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, Dubois.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.42,1:21:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呆着吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now stay!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.30,1:21:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给全世界孩子们的气球！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balloons to the children of the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.97,1:21:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美式空中飞人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trapeze americano!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.94,1:21:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是真的  - 是真的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is real.  - It's real!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.15,1:21:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.15,1:21:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要跟马戏团一起走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want to run away  with the circus?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.66,1:21:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 冒险的生活？  - 浪漫的生活？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Live a life of adventure?  - Full of romance?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.69,1:21:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 刺激的生活！  - 真正的生活！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And danger!  - Really living!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.03,1:21:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.86,1:22:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 啦-嗒 嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒，马戏团！ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Ra-da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, circus! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.70,1:22:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 嗒-嗒 嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒-嗒，爆炸头！ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Da-da da-da-da-da-da-da, Afro! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.37,1:22:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 马戏团 爆炸头，马戏团 爆炸头！  花衬衫，花衬衫，花衬衫，爆炸头！ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Circus Afro, Circus Afro!  Polka dot, polka dot, polka dot, Afro! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.47,1:22:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我喜欢扭来扭去，扭来扭去  我喜欢扭来扭去，扭来扭去 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I like to move it, move it  I like to move it, move it ∮
